# Modern Presentations
### Fast, Minimal & Interactive Slide Decks from Markdown

<!-- note: Welcome everyone! This slide deck runs 100% locally in ViewMD. -->

- **Separated by `---` 3-dashes**
- **Sleek Themes**: Midnight, Tokyo Night, Paper, Mocha, Daylight, Obsidian
- **Interactive**: Raw HTML, Canvas animations, and SVG morphs
