# Split Media Directives
### Inspired by Deckrun's Smart Layouts

![Server Architecture](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop "right")

- Use `![Alt](url "right")` for 50/50 right split
- Use `![Alt](url "left")` for left column layout
- Supports opacity modifiers like `"right opacity:0.85"`
- Content adjusts automatically to virtual 16:9 canvas

<!-- note: Demonstrate how images dock to the right side without requiring any CSS grid code. -->

