# Keynote Code Highlighting
### Syntax Formatted with Highlight.js

```typescript
import { parsePresentation } from './parser';

// Parse presentation into slides and extract directives
const deck = parsePresentation(rawMarkdown);

console.log(`Loaded ${deck.totalSlides} interactive slides`);
// Supports Keyboard navigation: Arrow keys, F (Fullscreen), O (Overview)
```

> "Simplicity is prerequisite for reliability." — Edsger W. Dijkstra

